+# Billing disputes
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` provides routing evidence for billing questions:
+
+- A message containing the case-sensitive text `refund` is classified as `refund-review`.
+- Every other message passed to the classifier is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+These classifications do not establish refund authorization, amounts, invoice status, or timing. Base those claims on verified evidence, and say when the required evidence is unavailable.

